Title: Fruquintinib as new treatment option in metastatic colorectal cancer patients: is there an optimal sequence?
Abstract: Available treatments for colorectal cancer are limited. However, in the last few years several advances and new treatment options became available and expanded the continuum of care in metastatic colorectal cancer (mCRC).

